config SOC_SPACEMIT_K3
bool "Spacemit K3 SoC support"
depends on ARCH_SPACEMIT || COMPILE_TEST
default y if ARCH_SPACEMIT
help
  Enable support for Spacemit K3 SoC power domain management.
  This driver provides generic power domain control over RPMI mailbox.

if SOC_SPACEMIT_K3

config SPACEMIT_K3_PM_DOMAIN
tristate "Spacemit K3 power domain driver"
depends on MAILBOX
select PM_GENERIC_DOMAINS
default y
help
  Say Y to enable power domain support for Spacemit K3 SoCs.
  This allows the kernel to manage power domains via RPMI protocol.

endif
